{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49781","headline":"临江仙 · 张泌","name":"临江仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟收湘渚秋江静，蕉花露泣愁红。\n五云双鹤去无踪，几回魂断，凝望向长空。\n翠竹暗留珠泪怨，闲调宝瑟波中。\n花鬟月鬓绿云重，古祠深殿，香冷雨和风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}